Did you train the robot to double the number in the box?

You can have the robot double a number by copying just the number
and then clicking the mouse button to drop the copy on the number.

Did you give the robot the box after training him?

The robot stopped because he is fussy and will only work on things
exactly like he's thinking about.  But Dusty can help.

Did you try to make the number in his thought bubble blank?

This one is tricky.  Here's what I would do.  I'd give the robot the box
and have him copy the 1 and drop it to double it. I'd press 'Escape'
to stop training him. I'd pick up Dusty and
press the button on his nose until I see 'E' for erase.
Then I'd move his mouth over the 1 in the robot's thought
bubble.  I press the space bar to turn him on.  I'd set Dusty down and
give the robot the box.  I'd wait until he stops and pick up the number
in the box.




